Explanation
This program creates a chatbot that interacts with users and answers common queries.


It uses predefined rules (if-elif conditions) to respond.


The chatbot checks user input and gives a suitable reply.



Working


The chatbot greets the user.


It takes user input continuously.


Matches input with keywords like:


hello/hi → Greeting


product → Product details


price/cost → Price info


order status → Order tracking


delivery → Delivery time


return → Return policy


time → Shows current time




If input is not matched → shows default message.


Chat ends when user types exit.



Functions Used


greet() → displays welcome message


chatbot_response() → generates reply


get_time() → shows current time


run_chatbot() → runs the chatbot loop



Output


Interactive conversation between user and chatbot


Responds to different customer queries


